    oa:editorialNote "\"Terragens' first interstellar polity, informally aligned with the First\nFederation.\" Timeline, 770: \"River of Stars Charter proclaimed at Epsilon\nEridani IID; leads to the foundation of the Eridanus League.\" The Sesharia\narticle has it fragmenting into the NoCoZo and the Solar Dominion, undated." ;
